{"id":"0c48874733bb3770","group":"16","path":"16/16-lem-definability-representability.md","title":"可定义性的表示条件","display":"lem-definability-representability — 可定义性的表示条件","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-lem-definability-representability","display":"lem-definability-representability — 可定义性的表示条件","depends_on":["[[16-df-definable]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Lemma 9.6.2, pp. 569–570 (PDF 589–590)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-lem-definability-representability","16-lem--definability-representability"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-lem-definability-representability"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-definability-representability — 可定义性的表示条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" href=\"?note=7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" title=\"16-df-definable\">16-df-definable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 9.6.2, pp. 569–570 (PDF 589–590)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-lem-definability-representability</span><span>16-lem--definability-representability</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" href=\"?note=7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" title=\"16-df-definable\">16-df-definable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Definable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Definable}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" href=\"?note=7dbb9ea84aee2b45\" title=\"16-df-definable\">16-df-definable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists V_X\\in\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists\\theta_X:V_X\\to pX)\\bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\theta_X)\\land\\theta_X^*X\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall J,u:J\\to pX)\\bigl(u^*X\\in P\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!w:J\\to V_X)\\theta_Xw=u\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists V_X\\in\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists\\theta_X:V_X\\to pX)\\bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\theta_X)\\land\\theta_X^*X\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall J,u:J\\to pX)\\bigl(u^*X\\in P\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!w:J\\to V_X)\\theta_Xw=u\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明（正向）：取定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_X:X&#39;\\to X\">\\(i_X:X&#39;\\to X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_X=pi_X\">\\(\\theta_X=pi_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*X\\to X\">\\(u^*X\\to X\\)</span> 的泛因子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>；笛卡尔泛性质将另一基因子提升成总范畴因子，故唯一。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_Xa=\\theta_Xb\">\\(\\theta_Xa=\\theta_Xb\\)</span>，则该共同箭头的重索引仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，由唯一性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=b\">\\(a=b\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_X\">\\(\\theta_X\\)</span> 是单态射。</li>\n<li>证明（反向）：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;=\\theta_X^*X\">\\(X&#39;=\\theta_X^*X\\)</span> 和选定提升 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_X\">\\(i_X\\)</span>。对笛卡尔 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:Y\\to X\">\\(f:Y\\to X\\)</span>，垂直同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\cong(pf)^*X\">\\(Y\\cong(pf)^*X\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(pf)^*X\\in P\">\\((pf)^*X\\in P\\)</span>，先取得唯一基因子，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_X\">\\(i_X\\)</span> 的笛卡尔性得到唯一总范畴因子。</li>\n<li>这正是子函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\mapsto\\{u:J\\to pX\\mid u^*X\\in P\\}\">\\(J\\mapsto\\{u:J\\to pX\\mid u^*X\\in P\\}\\)</span> 的可表示性。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Lemma 9.6.2, pp. 569–570 (PDF 589–590)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-definable","status":"resolved","id":"7dbb9ea84aee2b45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-definable]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-definable","status":"resolved","id":"7dbb9ea84aee2b45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)$，见 [[16-df-definable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-definable","status":"resolved","id":"7dbb9ea84aee2b45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Definable}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-definable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Definable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists V_X\\in\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists\\theta_X:V_X\\to pX)\\bigl[{}&\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(\\theta_X)\\land\\theta_X^*X\\in P\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall J,u:J\\to pX)\\bigl(u^*X\\in P\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists!w:J\\to V_X)\\theta_Xw=u\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"i_X:X'\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_X=pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"u^*X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_Xa=\\theta_Xb","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"a=b","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_X","display":false},{"tex":"X'=\\theta_X^*X","display":false},{"tex":"i_X","display":false},{"tex":"f:Y\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\cong(pf)^*X","display":false},{"tex":"(pf)^*X\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"i_X","display":false},{"tex":"J\\mapsto\\{u:J\\to pX\\mid u^*X\\in P\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1968,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-387","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-lem-definability-representability|lem-definability-representability — 可定义性的表示条件]]"}],"outgoing":["7dbb9ea84aee2b45","4ea27d39c2af987b","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}